# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# UNLICENSED FONTS — MUST NEVER BE COMMITTED.
#
# Gravur is the typeface the live WordPress site uses. It is commercial and we
# hold no licence for it. The files below exist only so the local demo can be
# shown in the original typeface. They must not enter the repo, the published
# build output, or any deployed artefact.
#
# Archivo (OFL) is the licensed substitute and is the default. See
# src/assets/fonts/gravur/README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/assets/fonts/gravur/*.woff
src/assets/fonts/gravur/*.woff2
